    "body": "# 1.06.07. OCCUPATION: ENTERTAINER (BASE WS 5)\n\n* **Operational Focus:** Performance Arts, Holo-Media, Oratory, Courtesan Intrigue, and Cultural Influence.\n* **EUFT Base Wealth Score:** **Base WS 5**\n* **Canonical Professional Skills (20 SP Allocation):** Any Expression Skills (and Social Manipulation)\n* **Recommended Feature Category (-1 CP Discount):** Skill Features\n* **Universal Occupational Traits Available:** *Background* (1 Trait from Secondary Occupation), *Trade Tools* (+2 Equipment), *High Pay* (+2 Wealth), *Professionalism* (+2 Reputation).\n\n# **ENTERTAINER**\n\nEntertainers might perform in various forms of art, such as music, dance, acting, or even virtual reality experiences. They could use advanced technology to create immersive and captivating performances, reaching audiences across different planets and star systems.Entertainers in the future may perform in a variety of ways, including music, dance, acting, and even virtual reality experiences. They can use advanced technology to create immersive and captivating performances that can reach audiences across different planets and star systems. The possibilities for entertainment are truly endless. As technology continues to evolve, so will the ways we can be entertained.\n\n## **Professional Skills**\n\nAny Expression Skills\n\n## **Recommended Features**\n\nSkill\n\n## **Archetypes**\n\nHolographic Performer\n\nPsionic Entertainer\n\nCircus Performer\n\nComedian\n\nDancer\n\nStoryteller\n\nMusician\n\nActor\n\nCourtesan\n\n## **Traits**\n\n### *Adaptable*\n\nAble to adjust performances to suit different audiences\n\n*\\+2 to a specific Skill Check, may change assigned Skill daily*\n\n### *Charismatic*\n\nOutgoing and charming\n\n*May take 10 on Diplomacy*\n\n### *Confident*\n\nComfortable in the spotlight\n\n*\\+2 Willpower*\n\n### *Creative*\n\nSkilled at coming up with new ideas\n\n*\\+1 Karma Point*\n\n### *Energetic*\n\nHigh levels of energy and enthusiasm\n\n*\\+1 Karma Point*\n\n### *Fans*\n\nHas a loyal following of fans\n\n*\\+2 Wealth and \\+1 Manipulations with Fans*\n\n### *Fellow Artists*\n\nHas close relationships with other performers\n\n*Gather Information checks made at Advantage when dealing with the entertainment scene*\n\n### *Freedom*\n\nValues independence and self-expression\n\n*Domination and Mind-Control Resistance Checks are made at Advantage*\n\n### *Fun*\n\nValues having a good time and making others happy\n\n*Regain a Karma Point when a crowd enjoys your performance*\n\n### *Venues*\n\nHas strong ties to certain performance venues\n\n*\\+2 Equipment (Hideout) and \\+1 Wealth*\n\n## **Occupation Character Visual Synthesis**\n\n## **07\\. ENTERTAINER**\n\n*Artist, Musician, Gladiator. Focus: Performance, Charisma.*\n\n* **IMPYRIUM:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Classical Sculptor** or **Orator**. Standing on a podium, reciting epic poetry to a rapt audience. Dressed in layers of silk.  \n  * **Style:** High Art, Greco-Roman Theater.  \n  * **Palette:** Theater Red, Spotlight White, Gold.  \n  * **Tokens:** Podium, drama, gesture, audience, culture.  \n* **SYNDICATE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Pop-Idol** with holographic hair and light-up clothes. Singing into a drone mic.  \n  * **Style:** Cyber-Pop, K-Pop Futurism.  \n  * **Palette:** Hot Pink, Electric Blue, White.  \n  * **Tokens:** Holograms, glitter, microphone, drones.  \n* **DYNASTY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Bard** playing a lute in a tavern. Colorful doublet, feather in cap. Telling stories of dragons.  \n  * **Style:** Medieval Minstrel.  \n  * **Palette:** Wood Brown, Firelight Orange, Velvet.  \n  * **Tokens:** Lute, tankard, fire, storytelling.  \n* **OUTWORLDS:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Saloon Singer** in a sparkly dress and cowboy boots. leaning on a piano. Smoky bar.  \n  * **Style:** Space Western Cabaret.  \n  * **Palette:** Red Velvet, Smoke Grey, Spotlight White.  \n  * **Tokens:** Microphone, piano, drink, sadness.  \n* **COALITION:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Club DJ** with cyber-arms mixing on a holographic deck. Massive speakers. Rave crowd.  \n  * **Style:** Cyberpunk Rave.  \n  * **Palette:** Strobe White, Laser Green, Darkness.  \n  * **Tokens:** Headphones, turntables, sweat, bass.  \n* **AULURAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Dancer** manipulating bioluminescent ribbons. Moving like water.  \n  * **Style:** Interpretive Dance, Bioluminescence.  \n  * **Palette:** Glowing Blue/Green, shadow.  \n  * **Tokens:** Ribbons, fluidity, grace, nature.  \n* **ALTERIAN ENCLAVE:**  \n  * **Context:** An **Illusionist** weaving stories out of hard-light sparkles. Elegant gestures.  \n  * **Style:** Magic Show, Fireworks.  \n  * **Palette:** Sparkle Gold, Magic Violet, Velvet.  \n  * **Tokens:** Wand, light shapes, awe, stage.  \n* **ASCENDANCY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Holodeck Actor** in a motion capture suit. Their avatar is projected above them.  \n  * **Style:** Virtual Performance.  \n  * **Palette:** Mocap Black/White, Projection Blue.  \n  * **Tokens:** Suit markers, hologram, acting.  \n* **ENTARI COMBINE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Fashion Icon** wearing a dress made of living water and gold. Paparazzi drones flashing.  \n  * **Style:** High Fashion, Met Gala.  \n  * **Palette:** Water Blue, Gold, Flash White.  \n  * **Tokens:** Dress, pose, cameras, red carpet.  \n* **MEKAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Geometry Display**. Spinning shapes and laser shows synchronized to math.  \n  * **Style:** Abstract Art, Screen Saver.  \n  * **Palette:** Neon Geometry, Black Void.  \n  * **Tokens:** Shapes, lasers, math, hypnosis.\n\n* **KITIN COLLECTIVE (THE STAR HIVE):**  \n  * **Context:** A **Manelli Harmonic Siren** projecting intoxicating psionic-acoustic chord progressions and bioluminescent light patterns that Entrance an entire amphitheater.  \n  * **Style:** Psionic-Acoustic Virtuoso, Pheromonal Performance.  \n  * **Palette:** Iridescent Obsidian, Bioluminescent Cyan, Emerald Silk, Amber Glow.  \n  * **Tokens:** Resonant antennae, visible sound-waves, hypnotic bioluminescence, grace.",
