    "body": "# 1.06.09. OCCUPATION: REPRESENTATIVE (BASE WS 6)\n\n* **Operational Focus:** Diplomacy, Governance, Corporate Executive Representation, and Statecraft.\n* **EUFT Base Wealth Score:** **Base WS 6**\n* **Canonical Professional Skills (20 SP Allocation):** Any Manipulation Skills (plus Culture, Law, Nobility, Ambassador)\n* **Recommended Feature Category (-1 CP Discount):** Skill Features\n* **Universal Occupational Traits Available:** *Background* (1 Trait from Secondary Occupation), *Trade Tools* (+2 Equipment), *High Pay* (+2 Wealth), *Professionalism* (+2 Reputation).\n\n# **REPRESENTATIVE**\n\nA Representative's occupation could involve diplomacy, negotiation, and communication between various factions, planets, or organizations. They might be responsible for maintaining relationships, resolving conflicts, and advocating for their constituents' interests whether they are in a governmental or corporate arena.\n\nA Governmental Representative might be responsible for representing the interests of their constituents in the legislative branch of government. They would do this by drafting and voting on legislation, and by participating in committee hearings and floor debates. They would also be responsible for communicating with their constituents and keeping them updated on the legislative process.\n\nA Corporate Representative might be responsible for representing the interests of their company in dealings with other companies, government agencies, and the public. They would do this by negotiating contracts, resolving disputes, and providing information about the company. They would also be responsible for communicating with the company's employees and keeping them updated on the company's activities.\n\nRepresentatives play an important role in maintaining order and cooperation between different groups. They use their skills in diplomacy, negotiation, and communication to build relationships, resolve conflicts, and advocate for the interests of their constituents.\n\n## **Professional Skills**\n\nAny Manipulation Skills\n\n## **Recommended Features**\n\nSkill\n\n## **Archetypes**\n\nInterstellar Diplomat\n\nTrade Envoy\n\nPeace Negotiator\n\nIntelligence Liaison\n\nCultural Ambassador\n\nCorporate Administrator\n\n## **Traits**\n\n### *Analytical*\n\nAbility to analyze data and information to make informed decisions\n\n*\\+2 Alertness*\n\n### *Conflict resolution*\n\nAbility to resolve conflicts effectively and find solutions that satisfy all parties involved\n\n*\\+2 Diplomacy*\n\n### *Creativity*\n\nAbility to think creatively and develop innovative solutions to complex problems\n\n*\\+1 Karma*\n\n### *Emotional intelligence*\n\nAbility to understand and manage their own emotions effectively, and read the emotions of others and respond appropriately to different emotional states\n\n*\\+2 Insight*\n\n### *Flexibility*\n\nAbility to adapt to changing circumstances and adjust plans and strategies as needed\n\n*\\+2 to a specific Skill Check, may change assigned Skill daily*\n\n### *Integrity*\n\nHonest and trustworthy, able to maintain a high level of integrity in their work\n\n*\\+1 Karma*\n\n### *Languages*\n\nAbility to speak multiple languages and communicate effectively with people from different cultures and backgrounds\n\n*+2 Knowledge (Language)*\n\n### *Negotiation*\n\nSkilled negotiator, able to find common ground with others and reach mutually beneficial agreements\n\n*\\+1 all Manipulation Skills*\n\n### *Networking*\n\nAbility to build strong relationships with others, including politicians, businesspeople, and other diplomats\n\n*Gather Information checks at Advantage*\n\n### *Time Management*\n\nAbility to manage time effectively and prioritize tasks to ensure that they are completed on time\n\n*Reduce Rush modifier to Skill check by 2*\n\n## **Occupation Character Visual Synthesis**\n\n## **09\\. REPRESENTATIVE**\n\n*Diplomat, Politician, Noble. Focus: Authority, Speech.*\n\n* **IMPYRIUM:**  \n  * **Context:** An **Imperial Senator**. Wearing a complex, towering headdress and heavy robes of state. Standing in a sunbeam, looking down at the viewer with \"quiet arrogance.\"  \n  * **Style:** Galactic Royalty, High Fashion History.  \n  * **Palette:** Imperial White, Gold, Platinum, Purple Sash.  \n  * **Tokens:** Headdress, ring, sunlight, height, sneer.  \n* **SYNDICATE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Board Member** at the head of a long glass table. Floating view of the city behind.  \n  * **Style:** CEO.  \n  * **Palette:** Glass, Steel, Suit Black, Sky Blue.  \n  * **Tokens:** Table, view, suit, power.  \n* **DYNASTY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Dragon Lord** on a throne. Armor, cape, crown. Sword resting against throne.  \n  * **Style:** Medieval King.  \n  * **Palette:** Gold, Crimson, Stone, Steel.  \n  * **Tokens:** Throne, crown, sword, banner.  \n* **OUTWORLDS:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Town Mayor** on a porch. Cowboy hat, sheriff star, shotgun leaning nearby.  \n  * **Style:** Frontier Mayor.  \n  * **Palette:** Wood, Dust, Badge Silver.  \n  * **Tokens:** Hat, badge, porch, rocking chair.  \n* **COALITION:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Union Boss** shouting into a megaphone. Surrounded by angry workers.  \n  * **Style:** Labor Leader.  \n  * **Palette:** Hardhat Yellow, Blue Collar, Grit.  \n  * **Tokens:** Megaphone, fist, crowd, sweat.  \n* **AULURAN:**  \n  * **Context:** An **Elder** sitting on a root-throne. Surrounded by animals. Wooden staff.  \n  * **Style:** Tribal Elder.  \n  * **Palette:** Root Brown, Leaf Green, Wisdom Grey (hair).  \n  * **Tokens:** Staff, animals, roots, peace.  \n* **ALTERIAN ENCLAVE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **High Elf Prince** standing on a balcony. Circlet, flowing robes, gazing at stars.  \n  * **Style:** Tolkien Elf Lord.  \n  * **Palette:** Silver, White, Starlight.  \n  * **Tokens:** Balcony, stars, circlet, melancholy.  \n* **ASCENDANCY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Councillor** in a circle of equals. Debate, open hand gestures.  \n  * **Style:** Democratic Leader.  \n  * **Palette:** White, Blue, Circle.  \n  * **Tokens:** Voting token, datapad, listening.  \n* **ENTARI COMBINE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Trade Baron** hosting a gala. Holding a glass of wine, laughing.  \n  * **Style:** Gatsby.  \n  * **Palette:** Champagne Gold, Tuxedo Black.  \n  * **Tokens:** Wine, party, chandelier, wealth.  \n* **MEKAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Consensus Avatar**. A golden face on a screen.  \n  * **Style:** AI Interface.  \n  * **Palette:** Screen Gold, Black surround.  \n  * **Tokens:** Face, pixels, speaker, data.\n\n* **KITIN COLLECTIVE (THE STAR HIVE):**  \n  * **Context:** A **Manelli Diplomatic Interface** in immaculate mimetic formalwear accented with glossy obsidian collar-plates, speaking with the unified, unshakeable voice of a billion minds in the Chorus.  \n  * **Style:** Voice of the Star Hive, Psionic Envoy.  \n  * **Palette:** Obsidian Black, Emerald Trim, Pulsating Cyan Halo, Porcelain Mimetic Skin.  \n  * **Tokens:** Subtle antennae, serene expression, Chorus synchronization, diplomatic seal.",
