    "body": "# 1.06.10. OCCUPATION: SCHOLAR (BASE WS 3)\n\n* **Operational Focus:** Academic Research, Xenology, Astrophysics, History, and Theoretical Science.\n* **EUFT Base Wealth Score:** **Base WS 3**\n* **Canonical Professional Skills (20 SP Allocation):** Academics and any Knowledge Skills\n* **Recommended Feature Category (-1 CP Discount):** Skill Features\n* **Universal Occupational Traits Available:** *Background* (1 Trait from Secondary Occupation), *Trade Tools* (+2 Equipment), *High Pay* (+2 Wealth), *Professionalism* (+2 Reputation).\n\n# **SCHOLAR**\n\nA Scholar is a character who specializes in academic pursuits, research, and study. They possess a comprehensive education in a range of scientific skills.A scholar is a character who specializes in academic pursuits, research, and study. They possess a comprehensive education in a range of scientific skills. They are often well-read and have a deep understanding of various subjects. Scholars are typically curious and inquisitive, and they enjoy learning new things. They are also often creative and innovative, and they are able to think outside the box. Scholars can be found in a variety of settings, including universities, libraries, and research labs. Overall, scholars are intelligent, curious, and dedicated individuals who play an important role in society by advancing knowledge and understanding.\n\n## **Professional Skills**\n\nAny Knowledge Skills\n\n## **Recommended Features**\n\nSkill\n\n## **Archetypes**\n\nXenology Expert\n\nGeneticist\n\nKnowledge (Language) Specialist\n\nHistorian\n\nAstrophysicist\n\nCybernetics Expert\n\nPlanetologist\n\nPsionicologist\n\nRoboticist\n\nScientist\n\nArchaeologist\n\nCosmologist\n\n## **Traits**\n\n### *Adaptability*\n\nOpen to new ideas, willing to learn and adapt.\n\n*\\+2 to a specific Skill Check, may change assigned Skill daily*\n\n### *Attention to detail*\n\nMeticulous in observations, measurements, and data analysis.\n\n*\\+2 Alertness*\n\n### *Collaboration*\n\nAble to effectively communicate and work with colleagues.\n\n*additional \\+1 to Aid bonuses*\n\n### *Continuous Learning*\n\nHas a thirst for knowledge and is committed to lifelong learning.\n\n*All Learning Checks are made at Advantage*\n\n### *Critical thinking*\n\nPossess strong critical thinking skills.\n\n*\\+1 Karma Point*\n\n### *Ethical conduct*\n\nAdheres to ethical standards in research and work.\n\n*\\+2 to any Manipulation checks when taking an Ethical side*\n\n### *Metacognition*\n\nAware of own cognitive abilities and strategies.\n\n*\\+1 to Reason (Intellect) and Willpower (Wisdom) Checks*\n\n### *Patience*\n\nUnderstands that scientific research and discovery often require patience.\n\n*Additional \\+1 bonus per stage of time for Meticulous Skill Checks*\n\n### *Problem-solving*\n\nAdept at identifying and solving problems.\n\n*Once per Day may reroll a Mental Skill Check*\n\n### *Technological innovation*\n\nAble to create, adapt, and improve technology in novel ways.\n\n*Knowledge (Technology) checks made at Advantage.*\n\n## **Occupation Character Visual Synthesis**\n\n## **10\\. SCHOLAR**\n\n*Scientist, Historian, Researcher. Focus: Knowledge, Books, Data.*\n\n* **IMPYRIUM:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Keeper of the Archive**. Surrounded by floating data-crystals. They are not discovering new things, but cataloging the old.  \n  * **Style:** Librarian of Alexandria.  \n  * **Palette:** Library light (warm/golden), Crystal Blue, Robe Grey.  \n  * **Tokens:** Crystals, catalog, silence, reverence, age.  \n* **SYNDICATE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Data-Analyst** staring at scrolling code on multiple screens. Neural jack plugged in.  \n  * **Style:** Data Scientist.  \n  * **Palette:** Screen Blue, Reflection, White Coat.  \n  * **Tokens:** Screens, coffee, code, focus.  \n* **DYNASTY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Royal Scribe** recording history in a leather tome. Heraldic imagery.  \n  * **Style:** Court Historian.  \n  * **Palette:** Ink Black, Parchment, Leather.  \n  * **Tokens:** Book, quill, crest, ink.  \n* **OUTWORLDS:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Field Researcher** examining a rock sample. Muddy knees, backpack.  \n  * **Style:** Geologist / Archaeologist.  \n  * **Palette:** Khaki, Mud, Rock Grey.  \n  * **Tokens:** Hammer, sample, magnifying glass, dirt.  \n* **COALITION:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Rogue Chemist** in a dirty lab. Bubbling beakers, gas mask.  \n  * **Style:** Mad Scientist / Cook.  \n  * **Palette:** Chemical Green, Dirty White, Yellow.  \n  * **Tokens:** Beakers, mask, fumes, danger.  \n* **AULURAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Life-Weaver** examining a glowing flower. Gentle touch.  \n  * **Style:** Botanist.  \n  * **Palette:** Flower Pink, Green, Soft Light.  \n  * **Tokens:** Flower, magnifying glass, soil.  \n* **ALTERIAN ENCLAVE:**  \n  * **Context:** An **Arcane Professor** teaching magic with a floating diagram.  \n  * **Style:** Wizard Teacher.  \n  * **Palette:** Magic Blue, chalk dust, Tweed/Robes.  \n  * **Tokens:** Wand, diagram, blackboard (holographic).  \n* **ASCENDANCY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Utopian Scientist** looking at a DNA helix hologram. Clean lab.  \n  * **Style:** Star Trek Science Officer.  \n  * **Palette:** Science Blue, Clean White, DNA Red.  \n  * **Tokens:** Hologram, scanner, clean lines.  \n* **ENTARI COMBINE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Xenologist** studying an alien artifact. Museum setting.  \n  * **Style:** Museum Curator.  \n  * **Palette:** Museum Lighting, Artifact Gold, Suit.  \n  * **Tokens:** Artifact, gloves, display case.  \n* **MEKAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Logic Node**. A server rack with a robotic arm organizing data-tapes.  \n  * **Style:** Librarian Bot.  \n  * **Palette:** Server Black, Tape Reel Brown.  \n  * **Tokens:** Tapes, arm, shelving, order.\n\n* **KITIN COLLECTIVE (THE STAR HIVE):**  \n  * **Context:** A **Manelli Genetic Archivist**communing with a floating sphere of emerald Proto-Flux, decoding ancestral genetic memories and xeno-biological sequences in real time.  \n  * **Style:** Genomatrix Xenobiologist, Genetic Memory Savant.  \n  * **Palette:** Proto-Flux Emerald, Synaptic Cyan, Glossy Obsidian, Amber.  \n  * **Tokens:** Floating bio-holos, genetic memory strands, wetware data-scrolls, sensory pits.",
