    "body": "# 1.06.12. OCCUPATION: SOLDIER (BASE WS 1)\n\n* **Operational Focus:** Professional Warfare, Combined Arms, Tactical Command, and Frontline Defense.\n* **EUFT Base Wealth Score:** **Base WS 1**\n* **Canonical Professional Skills (20 SP Allocation):** Any Combat Skills (plus Athletics, Intimidate, Tactics)\n* **Recommended Feature Category (-1 CP Discount):** Combat Features\n* **Universal Occupational Traits Available:** *Background* (1 Trait from Secondary Occupation), *Trade Tools* (+2 Equipment), *High Pay* (+2 Wealth), *Professionalism* (+2 Reputation).\n\n# **SOLDIER**\n\nA Soldier can be described as a highly trained and versatile combatant, skilled in various forms of warfare and tactics. They are often responsible for protecting their allies, engaging in direct combat with enemies, and carrying out strategic operations.A soldier is a highly trained and versatile combatant, skilled in various forms of warfare and tactics. They are often responsible for protecting their allies, engaging in direct combat with enemies, and carrying out strategic operations. Soldiers must be able to think quickly and make decisions under pressure. They must also be able to work as part of a team and follow orders. Soldiers play a vital role in protecting the faction they serve and its citizens. They are often the first to respond to natural disasters and other emergencies. They also help keep the peace and protect their faction's borders. Soldiers are brave and dedicated individuals who put their lives on the line to serve their faction’s interest.\n\n## **Professional Skills**\n\nAny Combat Skills\n\n## **Recommended Features**\n\nCombat\n\n## **Archetypes**\n\nInfantry\n\nHeavy Weapons Specialist\n\nSniper\n\nTactical Officer\n\nMedic\n\nPowered Armor Trooper\n\nSpecial Forces\n\nEmpowered\n\n## **Traits**\n\n### *Adaptable*\n\nAble to adapt to new situations quickly and can think on their feet\n\n*\\+2 to a specific Skill Check, may change assigned Skill daily*\n\n### *Attention to Detail*\n\nPay attention to details and are able to spot potential threats before they become a problem\n\n*\\+2 Alertness*\n\n### *Combat Training*\n\nExtensive training in combat tactics, weapons handling, and hand-to-hand combat\n\n*\\+2 Combat Skill of choice*\n\n### *Cool*\n\nAble to remain calm and focused even in high-pressure situations\n\n*\\+2 Willpower*\n\n### *Cunning*\n\nRely on their wits and cunning to achieve their objectives, often using deception and misdirection to outsmart their enemies\n\n*Additional \\+1 to appropriate maneuvers from having Edge*\n\n### *Discipline*\n\nDisciplined and able to follow orders without question, even in high-pressure situations\n\n*\\+2 Soldier Vocation*\n\n### *Loyal*\n\nFiercely loyal to their comrades and their mission\n\n*Domination and Mind-Control Resistance Checks are made at Advantage*\n\n### *Observant*\n\nAlert and observant, constantly scanning the area for potential threats\n\n*May take 10 on Alertness Checks*\n\n### *Physical Prowess*\n\nPhysically fit and strong, can endure long periods of physical activity and combat\n\n*\\+1 Might and Fortitude Checks*\n\n### *Rapid Response*\n\nAble to respond quickly to threats and can act decisively in high-pressure situations\n\n*\\+2 Initiative*\n\n### *Resourceful*\n\nAble to make weapons out of anything and can adapt to new situations quickly\n\n*Once per Day make a Skill Check of choice at Advantage*\n\n### *Stalker*\n\nSkilled in stealth and able to move without detection\n\n*May take 10 on Stealth Checks*\n\n### *Strategic*\n\nExperienced in planning and executing missions, skilled at analyzing the battlefield and making strategic decisions\n\n*\\+1 Karma Point*\n\n### *Team-Oriented*\n\nAble to work in teams and coordinate their efforts to achieve their objectives\n\n*additional \\+1 to Aid bonuses*\n\n### *Versatile*\n\nAble to operate in a variety of environments, including underwater and in zero-gravity\n\n*\\+1 Karma Point*\n\n### *Well-Equipped*\n\nEquipped with the latest technology and weaponry\n\n*\\+2 Equipment*\n\n## **Occupation Character Visual Synthesis**\n\n## **12\\. SOLDIER**\n\n*Warrior, Guard, Mercenary. Focus: Combat, Weapons, Armor.*\n\n* **IMPYRIUM:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Solar Legionnaire**. Full composite armor that looks like sculpted muscle and Greek statuary. Holding a Solar Pike (energy halberd). Face hidden by a smooth, featureless helm.  \n  * **Style:** Idealized Soldier, Statue come to life.  \n  * **Palette:** Polished White, Sun-Gold, Energy Yellow (Pike).  \n  * **Tokens:** Pike, cape, statue-armor, formation, perfection.  \n* **SYNDICATE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Drop-Marine** in white composite armor, gold visor. Holding a rail-rifle.  \n  * **Style:** High-Tech Trooper (Stormtrooper/Spartan).  \n  * **Palette:** White, Gold Visor, Black undersuit.  \n  * **Tokens:** Rifle, armor, visor, HUD.  \n* **DYNASTY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Man-at-Arms** in chainmail and tabard. Holding a halberd.  \n  * **Style:** Medieval Guard.  \n  * **Palette:** Chainmail Silver, Tabard colors, Pike Wood.  \n  * **Tokens:** Halberd, helmet, guard duty.  \n* **OUTWORLDS:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Militiaman** in a flak vest and jeans. Holding an old assault rifle.  \n  * **Style:** Rebel Fighter.  \n  * **Palette:** Denim Blue, Vest Green, Rust.  \n  * **Tokens:** Rifle, bandana, grit, sandbags.  \n* **COALITION:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Mercenary** in mismatched high-end armor. Big gun, cigar.  \n  * **Style:** Sci-Fi Merc.  \n  * **Palette:** Camo mix, Gunmetal, Smoke.  \n  * **Tokens:** Minigun, cigar, scars, armor.  \n* **AULURAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Shock-Trooper (Graa)**. Giant beast in chitin armor. Claws and bio-cannon.  \n  * **Style:** War Beast.  \n  * **Palette:** Fur, Chitin Black, Bio-Green.  \n  * **Tokens:** Claws, cannon, roar, muscle.  \n* **ALTERIAN ENCLAVE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Blade-Dancer**. Dual energy swords, light armor, flowing sash.  \n  * **Style:** Jedi / Swordmaster.  \n  * **Palette:** Energy Blade Blue, sash color, motion blur.  \n  * **Tokens:** Swords, pose, grace, light.  \n* **ASCENDANCY:**  \n  * **Context:** A **Peacekeeper** in blue uniform holding a stun rifle. Riot shield.  \n  * **Style:** Police / UN Peacekeeper.  \n  * **Palette:** Blue helmet, White armor, Shield clear.  \n  * **Tokens:** Shield, stun gun, badge, protection.  \n* **ENTARI COMBINE:**  \n  * **Context:** A **House Guard** in ceremonial but functional armor. Halberd-blaster.  \n  * **Style:** Royal Guard.  \n  * **Palette:** Teal, Gold, Plume.  \n  * **Tokens:** Halberd, cape, standing tall.  \n* **MEKAN:**  \n  * **Context:** A **War-Frame**. Heavy combat robot. Gun-arms.  \n  * **Style:** Battle Droid.  \n  * **Palette:** Gunmetal, Warning Stripes, Red Eye.  \n  * **Tokens:** Guns, heavy steps, armor, war.\n\n* **KITIN COLLECTIVE (THE STAR HIVE):**  \n  * **Context:** A **Murex Shock Phalanx Trooper** encased in thick, sloped glossy obsidian carapace armor, wielding a heavy bio-plasma rifle fed directly by green vein-piping from their own circulatory system.  \n  * **Style:** Biomorphic Frontline Infantry, Swarm Phalanx.  \n  * **Palette:** Glossy Obsidian Carapace, Arterial Emerald, Bio-Plasma Red/Cyan.  \n  * **Tokens:** Sloped chitin plate, vein-linked bio-rifle, mandible visor, fearless lockstep.",
